        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Devasion 0.5 – The Intergalactic Upgrade Adventure!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by z-i-r.de </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an action-packed adventure in the depths of space! In Devasion 0.5, you pilot a small, agile spaceship through dangerous galaxies filled with obstacles, colored rocks, and explosive surprises. Your mission: Destroy the multicolored rocks to clear the path and advance deeper into the levels. Each rock presents new challenges – some are tough, others are vulnerable to certain weapons or projectile colors. Only those who combine their knowledge cleverly will progress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect numerous gadgets and upgrades along the way to improve your ship. Enhanced lasers, shields, or out-of-control missiles – every upgrade can mean the difference between victory and defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Fast, precise controls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Color-matching and destruction mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Numerous power-ups and individual upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Retro-inspired graphics with a modern twist </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Dynamic soundtrack for a galactic feel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to blast your way through the rocky waves and push your ship to its limits? Devasion 0.5 awaits your command.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Devasion 0.5 – The Intergalactic Upgrade Adventure!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by z-i-r.de </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an action-packed adventure in the depths of space! In Devasion 0.5, you pilot a small, agile spaceship through dangerous galaxies filled with obstacles, colored rocks, and explosive surprises. Your mission: Destroy the multicolored rocks to clear the path and advance deeper into the levels. Each rock presents new challenges – some are tough, others are vulnerable to certain weapons or projectile colors. Only those who combine their knowledge cleverly will progress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect numerous gadgets and upgrades along the way to improve your ship. Enhanced lasers, shields, or out-of-control missiles – every upgrade can mean the difference between victory and defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Fast, precise controls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Color-matching and destruction mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Numerous power-ups and individual upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Retro-inspired graphics with a modern twist </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Dynamic soundtrack for a galactic feel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to blast your way through the rocky waves and push your ship to its limits? Devasion 0.5 awaits your command.</p>",
